// log-normal size (a 1.5-4 mm drop throws a crown ~1-3 cm wide), a ragged crown rim that rises and collapses
// within ~30-40 ms, 3 droplets flung out on ballistic arcs, and in ~1/4 of impacts a thin Worthington jet with a
// bead on top. Returns (body, glint): the thin water wall barely shows (it refracts the ground behind it); what a
